//! |--------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
//! | `/`          | auto-submitting form POST to GitHub's App-creation page    |
//! | `/callback`  | manifest code → credentials, then redirect to the install  |
//! | `/installed` | GitHub's post-install redirect; reports the installation   |

